  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/fish/piranha.py): a red-bellied piranha, 30 cm -- DEEP-BODIED, nearly a disc (its depth over half its standard length), a blunt rounded head with a steep forehead, the heavy JUTTING lower jaw and both jaws lined with TRIANGULAR TEETH (`horn`s) in the parted lips; the throat, belly, lower jaw, pectorals, pelvics and the long anal fin RED, the rest silver-grey glittering over fine scales; the dorsal mid-back, the little ADIPOSE fin, a broad dark tail; a red eye. Each fin is one membrane sheet. A SWIMMER (the fish's plumbing).",
